{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find, approach, grab and process an object in sequence. Move to destination if reached. Otherwise scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
